DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmaannccttll utility compress or uncompress manual pages in directory path.
     If possible, .so's are replaced with hard links.

     The following options are available:

     --hheellpp   Print options and exit.

     --ccoommpprreessss
             Compress uncompressed man pages (eliminating .so's).

     --uunnccoommpprreessss
             Uncompress compressed man pages.

